  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Telekinesis; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> belt; <strong>Price</strong> 2,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nWhen you wear this belt, you store inanimate objects in the air, where they slowly orbit around you until you pick them up again. When you drop an item you are holding you may choose to store it in orbit around you. You may retrieve an object in orbit as a free action. You may only store one object of Small size or smaller in orbit, or a number of smaller objects whose total size category is Small or less. If you possess the Orbit talent the capacity of your Orbit increases by one Small-sized object.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Telekinesis sphere (Orbit); <strong>Cost</strong> 1,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed selection: 2000 gp, one Small-size orbit capacity.</p><p>A one-pound belt stores objects in open orbit rather than inside a bag. Native equipment preserves its belt slot; no container, bundled objects, pounds-based capacity, weight exemption or automatic inventory duplication. One Small-size total and the existing-Orbit interaction are resolved deliberately.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
